    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "4a6e220662eea2ab161f": "Elune has granted the night elves many gifts. In return, it is our responsibility to safeguard these forests from the demonic taint that the Horde always brings with it.",
        "5d1922f8a4c0fd3c9bb8": "I only teach students who have already mastered the basics. You must seek out the night elf Darianna in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. Her skills will be a perfect complement to yours.",
        "872bfff0303cfd6b6835": "Always double-check your measurements before you begin to cut the leather. We cannot afford to waste materials.",
        "c495dfac813bddb4b4da": "Train me.",
        "dfb1f879b5c069a4d178": "Training you further is beyond my abilities. Speak to Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He is always glad to help talented students."
      },
      "name": "Aayndia Floralwind",
      "subName": "Expert Leatherworker",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.4a6e220662eea2ab161f": {
